# ── Logs & Temporary Files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp

# ── Local data stores (personal data — never belongs in version control) ───────
# server_accounts.db (emails, password hashes, synced scan text, family data)
# and server_audit.db (audit-log excerpts) are runtime state, not source, and
# both were previously tracked despite DPDP_COMPLIANCE.md claiming otherwise —
# see DPDP_PROTECTION_SUITE_REPORT.md. `git rm --cached` was run once to
# untrack the existing copies; this rule stops it from happening again.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Ignore generated test files and APKs
*.apk
*.json
ScamShield_Test_APKs/
test_apks_source/
com.sh
commit.sh
